        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Raymond Mamrak, Jenni \"JWoww\" Farley, Kristinia DeBarge, Chris Cardillo, Ashlee Keating\n- Films: The Mint\n- Television series: Jersey Shore, Snooki & JWoww\n- Roles: director, actor, executive producer, reality star, record executive\n\nFacts:\n- Jenni \"JWoww\" Farley first came to prominence as one of the eight main cast members of the MTV reality series Jersey Shore.\n- Jenni \"JWoww\" Farley became a main cast member of the spin-off series Snooki & JWoww.\n- The Mint is a 2015 comedy film directed by Raymond Mamrak.\n- The Mint stars Jenni \"JWoww\" Farley, Kristinia DeBarge, Chris Cardillo, and Ashlee Keating.\n- In The Mint, Chris Cardillo stars opposite Jenni \"JWoww\" Farley.\n- Jenni \"JWoww\" Farley also serves as an executive producer of The Mint.\n- In The Mint, Chris Cardillo plays a record executive trying to get his company back on track after the death of his parents.",
